{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1477122-adding-in-the-teros-of-atlantis-to-my-chronicle-finally","id":1477122,"title":"Adding in the Teros of Atlantis to my Chronicle (finally)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-23T14:57:25-07:00","id":1477122,"title":"Adding in the Teros of Atlantis to my Chronicle (finally)","content":"Been running my Chronicle for some time getting the players used to the system and into their Roles . As my troupe leans more into role-playing than action (I try to balance the two), I have been leaning on the Action movie/ Modern Mythology suggestion in Origins , but have been quietly leaving clues about the Teros laying about.<br /> <br /> I've worked at a heavy does of Mystery Cults, Other Cults, Weird Happenings and while not World of Darkness level of darkly messed up things, I have leaned into some of the nastier aspects of some Pantheons to give the players a set of Antagonists Referred to as the Harbingers of Ragnarok, which ranges from a full list of mook cultists to Professional soldiers with Aesier Titan Scions as the main opposition.<br /> <br /> All the while leaving more hints that the players have mysterious backers cleaning up after some of their more showy incidents and a general rising of tensions in the opposition as they grow frustrated that someone is out their messing with them. While players have had a few close calls which have drive them to distraction. So the palyers have been digging into what might be giving them help.<br /> <br /> And so our more tech savvy Scion of Shiva finally was able to puzzle through a series of tests by the Teros that had been keeping an eye on her and the others. After having met with them the first time and liking what they had seen, the Teros finally seem to be willing to meet with the players. Which will be happening in the next few sessions.<br /> <br /> As a result I have been working a bit on the theology and Astrological symbols. What I have is a bit modified from Hittite and Assyrian, but hey not getting paid for this. Comments are welcome<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Atlantean (Teros) Zodiac:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Seedlings\u201d Or \u201cDandelion Bristle\u201d = The Pleiades</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Water Buffalo\u201d = Taurus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Aminus and her Seed Vase\u201d = Orion</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Wise Man\u201d = Perseus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Sextant\u201d or \u201cOcean God\u2019s Gift\u201d = Auriga</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Divine Twins\u201d = Gemini</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Scourge Of the Sea\u201d = Cancer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Great Lion\u201d = Leo</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Seed Furrow\u201c = Virgo</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Eternal Struggle\u201d = Libra</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Patient Hunter\u201d = Scorpius</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Judge\u2019s Monster\u201d = Sagittarius</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Great Sea Dragon\u201d = Aquarius</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Dolphins\u201d = Pisces</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Sower\u201d = Aries</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-23T20:06:50-07:00","id":1477156,"title":"","content":"I come from position of other Teros fan - I use them in my now chronicle, one of PC is from them - but how those signs are really related to Teros gods, beside Amnis? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> All I see is - 'we just renamed normal Zodiac signs of Western world'...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-24T04:35:41-07:00","id":1477190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1477122-adding-in-the-teros-of-atlantis-to-my-chronicle-finally?p=1477156#post1477156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I come from position of other Teros fan - I use them in my now chronicle, one of PC is from them - but how those signs are really related to Teros gods, beside Amnis? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> All I see is - 'we just renamed normal Zodiac signs of Western world'...</div> </div> </div> </div>A Fair question. I'm still working on it, but a lot of these formations from the western world were adapted from Babylonian constellations. Many of these formations figure prominently into many pantheons. I've still working on trying to come up with thematic names. but it's a start","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}